    "detailed_description": "Explore, build, fight! Wieldo is a procedural open-world building game with a healthy amount of sword wielding combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build all the things</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/99be5e8590166a1a3ae75a6f1579d551.poster.avif?t=1705574099\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/99be5e8590166a1a3ae75a6f1579d551.webm?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/99be5e8590166a1a3ae75a6f1579d551.mp4?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The world is yours to make over. From convenient contraptions to beautiful sceneries, activate your build mode and take advantage of the unlimited supply of blocks to edit the world to your liking. \ud83c\udfa8 Extend your block palette by engaging with all the content the world has to offer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight all the monsters</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/a0af586e6484283d5828e94808ba76d8.poster.avif?t=1705574099\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/a0af586e6484283d5828e94808ba76d8.webm?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/a0af586e6484283d5828e94808ba76d8.mp4?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Face the challenge of the shrines of combat and refine your combat skills. Keep triumphing and be met with increasing resistance, until you collect the rewards of the mighty bosses! Or die trying \ud83d\udc80 They\u2019re dangerous, you\u2019ve been warned.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore all the places</strong></h2>The world you spawn in has been procedurally generated just for you! All the biomes have something unique to offer. \ud83c\udf81 Get ready for a series of block palette extensions and new effects to use in your builds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bring all the friends</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/6318472bb2f7d57822706b456a6464de.poster.avif?t=1705574099\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/6318472bb2f7d57822706b456a6464de.webm?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/6318472bb2f7d57822706b456a6464de.mp4?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Wieldo is a multiplayer co-op game, share a world with your friends! Help each other out or build silly contraptions. \ud83e\udd21 There is always something fun to do when surrounded by friends.",
    "about_the_game": "Explore, build, fight! Wieldo is a procedural open-world building game with a healthy amount of sword wielding combat.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build all the things</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/99be5e8590166a1a3ae75a6f1579d551.poster.avif?t=1705574099\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/99be5e8590166a1a3ae75a6f1579d551.webm?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/99be5e8590166a1a3ae75a6f1579d551.mp4?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>The world is yours to make over. From convenient contraptions to beautiful sceneries, activate your build mode and take advantage of the unlimited supply of blocks to edit the world to your liking. \ud83c\udfa8 Extend your block palette by engaging with all the content the world has to offer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Fight all the monsters</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/a0af586e6484283d5828e94808ba76d8.poster.avif?t=1705574099\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/a0af586e6484283d5828e94808ba76d8.webm?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/a0af586e6484283d5828e94808ba76d8.mp4?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Face the challenge of the shrines of combat and refine your combat skills. Keep triumphing and be met with increasing resistance, until you collect the rewards of the mighty bosses! Or die trying \ud83d\udc80 They\u2019re dangerous, you\u2019ve been warned.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore all the places</strong></h2>The world you spawn in has been procedurally generated just for you! All the biomes have something unique to offer. \ud83c\udf81 Get ready for a series of block palette extensions and new effects to use in your builds.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Bring all the friends</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/6318472bb2f7d57822706b456a6464de.poster.avif?t=1705574099\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/6318472bb2f7d57822706b456a6464de.webm?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1954990/extras/6318472bb2f7d57822706b456a6464de.mp4?t=1705574099\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Wieldo is a multiplayer co-op game, share a world with your friends! Help each other out or build silly contraptions. \ud83e\udd21 There is always something fun to do when surrounded by friends.",
